19
00:01:13.759 --> 00:01:16.139
You see, one must clearly differentiate.

20
00:01:16.139 --> 00:01:20.719
When I move like this, it is very different from this movement at the level of my liver.

21
00:01:21.339 --> 00:01:25.169
So, if I want to rework a tissue, I restore it to its motility,

